{"path":"/es/tip/30-16","title":"No golpee a su hijo ni grite llamándolo estúpido: los niños a menudo golpeados o insultados muestran más problemas de conducta y emocionales | HowToLiveBetter","description":"Los niños castigados físicamente con frecuencia muestran más agresión y problemas psicológicos, más distancia con los padres y golpes más duros. Si u…","lang":"es","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter — inicio","href":"/es"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"Navegación principal"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/es/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Libro"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/es/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Top 50"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/es/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Reto diario"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/es/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Mi lista"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Más"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","he